# LF everywhere, including in the working tree on Windows.
#
# Not a style preference: .github/workflows/ci.yml carries a bash heredoc, and a CRLF line ending
# inside one makes the terminator fail to match, which fails the job with a shell parse error rather
# than anything resembling the actual cause.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git never guesses at them.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.glb binary
*.stl binary
*.3mf binary
